msgid "Only for ETS 6 devices: this test compares the device against an image generated the ETS 6 way. A device last programmed with ETS 5 uses a different byte layout and will show large false differences - the result is only meaningful for a device last programmed with ETS 6."
msgstr "Samo za naprave ETS 6: ta preizkus napravo primerja s sliko, ustvarjeno na način ETS 6. Naprava, ki je bila nazadnje programirana z ETS 5, uporablja drugačno razporeditev bajtov in bo pokazala velike lažne razlike – rezultat je smiseln le za napravo, ki je bila nazadnje programirana z ETS 6."

msgid "Structural differences (whole tables differ) can mean the device was last programmed with ETS 5, whose byte layout differs. Differences in values only usually mean the device holds a different configuration."
msgstr "Strukturne razlike (razlikujejo se cele tabele) lahko pomenijo, da je bila naprava nazadnje programirana z ETS 5, katerega razporeditev bajtov je drugačna. Razlike samo v vrednostih običajno pomenijo, da ima naprava drugačno konfiguracijo."

msgid "Test/Program mirror an ETS 6 programming. If a test reports whole tables as different, the device was likely last programmed with ETS 5 (different byte layout)."
msgstr "Preizkus/programiranje posnema programiranje z ETS 6. Če preizkus javi cele tabele kot različne, je bila naprava verjetno nazadnje programirana z ETS 5 (drugačna razporeditev bajtov)."

