msgid "The device did not respond ({detail})."
msgstr "Naprava se ni odzvala ({detail})."

msgid "Check that the device is powered and can be reached from this interface (line, coupler)."
msgstr "Preverite, ali je naprava napajana in dosegljiva iz tega vmesnika (linija, spojnik)."

msgid "For a new device, put exactly one device into programming mode. Otherwise check that the device is powered and can be reached from this interface (line, coupler)."
msgstr "Pri novi napravi preklopite v način programiranja natanko eno napravo. Sicer preverite, ali je naprava napajana in dosegljiva iz tega vmesnika (linija, spojnik)."

msgid "The download failed after it had begun to write the device, so the device may be partially loaded. Program it again to restore a working state. Cause: {cause}"
msgstr "Prenos ni uspel, potem ko je že začel pisati v napravo, zato je naprava morda naložena le delno. Znova jo programirajte, da obnovite delujoče stanje. Vzrok: {cause}"

